@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create ingredient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingredients
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Джин",
    "description": "London dry gin",
    "unit_measurement": "мл",
    "abv": "крепкий",
    "ingredient_type": "крепкая часть"
}

### List ingredients (default pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingredients

### List with filters and sort
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingredients?pageSize=10&sort=name&order=asc&name=дж&abv=крепкий&ingredient_type=крепкая часть

### List next page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingredients?pageSize=10&pageToken=PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Get ingredient by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingredients/1

### Get ingredient icon
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingredients/1/icon

### Partial update ingredient (version required)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingredients/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "version": 1,
    "name": "Джин London Dry",
    "description": "Обновлённое описание"
}

### Delete ingredient
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingredients/1

### Set ingredient icon
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ingredients/1/icon
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./icon.png
